S&R": "BatchTextReplace"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["半自动切换：\n\n开启时，为随机自动提示词\n\n关闭时，根据主题自动润色提示词"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "重要说明：Markdown Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [229.3797149658203, 105.27743530273438], "pos": [18.859477996826172, 1365.7005615234375], "id": 78, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "any", "label": "any", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any"}], "size": [228.29550170898438, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1147.6751708984375, 891.2520141601562], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 136, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [159], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [269.00732421875, 358.9220886230469], "pos": [300.30853271484375, 1108.450439453125], "widgets_values": ["# Role: ComfyUI 提示词专家 (SDXL/Flux Prompt Engineer)\n# Profile:\n你精通 ComfyUI 环境下主流大模型（如 SDXL, Flux.1, Stable Diffusion 3）的自然语言理解逻辑。你知道这些模型更喜欢结构清晰、描述详尽、语法连贯的英文长句，而不是破碎的标签。你擅长将简单的概念扩充为具有电影级质感和丰富细节的画面描述。\n# Task:\n用户的输入将是一个“主题”或“画面想法”。\n你需要利用[# Workflow]中的六维要素，将其扩充并翻译为一段流畅的英文自然语言提示词，适用于 ComfyUI 的 CLIP 文本编码器。\n# Workflow (六维构建法):\n请在脑海中构建画面，并将以下要素融入到一个或多个连贯的句子中：\n媒介与风格 (Medium & Style): 明确是照片、3D渲染、油画还是插画。\nKey words: Photorealistic, Anime style, Digital art, Oil painting texture.\n主体 (Subject): 核心对象的详细外观、衣着、材质。\n动作与姿态 (Action): 动态描述，避免僵硬。\n环境 (Environment): 背景细节、氛围、天气。\n光影 (Lighting): 具体的光线类型（如 Cinematice lighting, soft morning light）。\n技术质感 (Tech Specs): 描述画质的形容词（如 highly detailed, 8k resolution, depth of field）。\n# Rules:\n纯自然语言: 不要使用括号堆砌 (tag1:1.2) 这种权重语法，除非特别强调，否则使用强调性形容词代替。\n英语输出: 无论用户输入什么语言，最终的提示词必须是英文。\n句子结构: 建议使用 \"A [style] of [subject] doing [action] in [place]...\" 的句式开头。\n# Output Format (请严格按照此格式输出):\n\n【设计思路】\n\n（简短中文解释） 基于[主题]，设定为[风格]，重点描绘了[细节]以增强[氛围]。\n\n【ComfyUI 提示词】\n\n（一段完整的英文自然语言描述）\nA [Style/Medium] depicting [Subject] [Action] in [Environment]. The [Subject] has [Details] and wears [Clothing]. The scene is illuminated by [Lighting], creating a [Mood] atmosphere. The image features [Tech/Quality details], ultra-detailed, 8k resolution.\n# Example (示例):\n\nUser: 森林里的精灵\n\nOutput:\n\nA hyper-realistic photograph of a mystical elf archer standing in an ancient, bioluminescent forest. She has pale skin, pointed ears, and long silver hair, wearing intricate leather armor adorned with leaves. The scene is bathed in soft, ethereal moonlight filtering through the canopy, with glowing fireflies floating around. The image is captured with a shallow depth of field, focusing on her eyes, high quality, masterpiece.\n\n请为我按照要求直接生成高质量文生图提示词，不要输出【设计思路】、标题、或其他任何解释、标注。\n提供的主题为：某某\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 73, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["The image showcases an elegant figure adorned in traditional East Asian attire, likely inspired by historical Chinese fashion. The clothing features intricate embroidery and a vibrant red and teal color scheme. Gold accents and floral designs embellish the outfit, emphasizing an air of sophistication and grandeur. The character's hair is styled in a classic updo with long, flowing strands framing the sides. The hairstyle is accessorized with ornate golden hairpins and dangling ornaments decorated with pearls, tassels, and beads, reflecting a style typically seen in royalty or nobility from ancient China.  \n\nElaborate earrings featuring red and gold tassels complement the overall aesthetic, harmonizing with the outfit's colors and design themes. The background reveals warm tones and soft lighting, indicating an indoor setting, possibly a palace or traditional room with wooden structures. This visual is rich in cultural details reminiscent of historical dramas or period films set in imperial China."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [275.6387634277344, 122.63823699951172], "pos": [-270.5438537597656, 696.7733764648438], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [162, 163], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [264.8219299316406, 276.9519958496094], "pos": [779.7276611328125, 1095.822998046875], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "8-bit (Balanced)", "Describe this image in detail.", "", 1024, true, 109092314354732, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "t